      "headline": "VP, Lead Software Engineer at JPMorgan Chase & Co.",
      "about": "8 years of experience in Application Integration with Informatica Intelligent Cloud Services (IICS) - Cloud Application Integration, Apigee API Gateway and webMethods Integration Server at JP Morgan & Chase as Associate. \n\nGood hands-on experience in building APIs using IICS processes, connectors and service connectors and BPEL Processes to develop custom code using Java/SQL.Created IICS API Processes to integrate with Sales force,Service Now, Mendix, Workday,SAP BAPI, JDBC Connectors. Good hands-on in process monitoring, secure agent administration, exception handling for the processes in IICS. \n\nGood experience with API Proxies, Swagger API spec creation & deployment to Developer Portal, Org Administration and custom reports with Analytics module in Apigee Public Cloud & Private Cloud. \n\nGood development hands on experience with webMethods in Pub-Sub model, Trading Networks, Active Transfer, REST services, Web Services & Adapters in IS versions 8.2, 9.7,10.1.\n\nBuilt CICD Automation for APIGEE local development, testing & deployment using Git, Jenkins.Has been rewarded with “Digital Bravo Award” for the implementation of CICD framework and integrating across all firm-wide security scans prior to code deployment & code management under one pipeline. \n\nWorked in DevOps model, hold hands on experience in both development & support, played varied roles in various projects. \n\nAdaptable & interested in rapid learning/exploring new components/technologies and sharing knowledge. \nPlayed the role of Subject Matter Expert for the domain & technology expertise with an aspiration to architect the solutions.",
